{
  "_readme": "Lean MVP startup on AWS. Cost-conscious architecture serving early customers. CloudFront CDN + S3 static site + API Gateway v2 + Lambda + DynamoDB + SES + CloudWatch. Estimated ~$15-30/mo at low traffic.",
